From e31b7b008276028b03c8bfd010f6b37a6f49cd25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanyog Kale <skale@habana.ai>
Date: Fri, 01 Apr 2022 14:38:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-77251] gaudi3: add erom functionality

This patch add erom functionality in recovery flow.
As part of EROM recovery, boot descriptor is downloaded
and PCIe and recovery image is downloaded and executed.

Change-Id: I9e9f49c1866dff7faa26be442d12dfce61a54c57
---

diff --git a/arch/gaudi3/arc/recovery.c b/arch/gaudi3/arc/recovery.c
index c094a00..037d2f4 100644
--- a/arch/gaudi3/arc/recovery.c
+++ b/arch/gaudi3/arc/recovery.c
@@ -7,11 +7,14 @@
